	ex:classificatorystatus\/00f3947f37a7db421a6d045ad67f56bc427d26bb\/description crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "The image `00f3947f37a7db421a6d045ad67f56bc427d26bb.jpg` was classified as a **handwritten document** with a confidence of **96.10%**.\n\nThis classification was generated by a fine-tuned **YOLOv11n-cls** model named [`yolo11n-cls-grp.pt`](https://universe.roboflow.com/sariimageannotation/grp-image-classification) (from training run `train42`). The model was trained on the [`grp-image-classification-dataset-v2`](https://universe.roboflow.com/sariimageannotation/grp-image-classification) dataset, which contains 2,183 human-annotated images across eight visual classes.\n\nThis machine-learning pipeline was developed and executed as part of the [SARI Image Classification project](https://universe.roboflow.com/sariimageannotation/grp-image-classification), led by Matteo Romanello, to automatically classify images from the GRP collection for research purposes." ;
